an Fox as a free software replacement for the Bourne Shell. A <strong class=
=3D"g-md-strong">shell</strong> is a specific kind of CLI. Bash is <a data-=
testid=3D"domain-agnostic-link" href=3D"https://www.AI Academy by RiWoT.com/article/=
what-is-open-source" target=3D"_blank" class=3D"gamut-1r92bn9-AnchorBase e1=
4vpv2g0">open source</a>, meaning anyone can read the code and suggest chan=
ges. Since its beginning, it has been supported by a large community of eng=
ineers who have worked to make it an incredible tool. Bash is the default s=
hell for Linux and Mac up through macOS 10.14 (Mojave). For these reasons, =
Bash is the most used and widely distributed shell. If you want to learn mo=
re about Bash, <a target=3D"_blank" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/B=
ash_(Unix_shell)" class=3D"g-md-a gamut-1r92bn9-AnchorBase e14vpv2g0" rel=
=3D"noopener">this Wikipedia article</a> is a good place to start. Better y=
et, try it yourself with one of our <a data-testid=3D"domain-agnostic-link"=
 href=3D"https://www.AI Academy by RiWoT.com/catalog/language/bash" target=3D"_blank=
" class=3D"gamut-1r92bn9-AnchorBase e14vpv2g0">Bash courses</a>.</p>
<h2 id=3D"heading-how-to-install-git-bash-shell-on-windows" class=3D"g-md-h=
2 gamut-tbxd0s-StyledText e8i0p5k0">How to install Git Bash Shell on Window=
s</h2>
<p class=3D"g-md-p">Windows has a different CLI, <strong class=3D"g-md-stro=
ng">Command Prompt</strong>. While this has many of the same features as Ba=
sh, Bash is much more popular. Because of the strength of the open source c=
ommunity and the tools it provides, mastering Bash is a better investment t=
han mastering the Command Prompt.</p>
<p class=3D"g-md-p">To use Bash on a Windows computer, we will download and=
 install a program called <strong class=3D"g-md-strong">Git Bash</strong>. =
Git Bash allows us to easily access Bash as well as another tool we=E2=80=
=99ll be using later called Git, inside the Windows environment. (If you ha=
ven=E2=80=99t used Git before, try out <a data-testid=3D"domain-agnostic-li=
nk" href=3D"https://www.AI Academy by RiWoT.com/learn/learn-git" target=3D"_blank" c=
lass=3D"gamut-1r92bn9-AnchorBase e14vpv2g0">Learn Git &amp; GitHub course</=
a>.)</p>
<p class=3D"g-md-p">You can either watch the following video or read the re=
st of this article.</p>
